{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09401","headline":"郊居言志 · 韦应物","name":"郊居言志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"负暄衡门下，望云归远山。\n但要尊中物，余事岂相关。\n交无是非责，且得任疎顽。\n日夕临清涧，逍遥思虑闲。\n出去唯空屋，弊箦委窗间。\n何异林栖鸟，恋此复来还。\n世荣斯独已，颓志亦何攀。\n唯当岁丰熟，闾里一欢颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}